 "intro_html": "Hawaii's favourite onigiri: Spam seared until caramelised, glazed in a quick teriyaki sauce, and pressed onto a block of warm rice with furikake, then wrapped in a strip of nori like a belt. A musubi mold makes it easy; the <b>empty Spam can</b>, lined with plastic wrap, works too. For the rice and more fillings see <a href=\"onigiri.html\">onigiri</a>.",
