  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Tip the Spam out of the can. <b>Keep the can</b> if you have no mold — wash it, it's your mold.</li><li>Cut the block into <b>8 even slices</b>, about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 cm</span> thick, each the shape of the can's top.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Slice the Spam",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Cut the block into 8 even slices, about 1 cm thick.",
      "src": "illustrations/spam-musubi/2-how1.webp?v=bc1212061e"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/spam-musubi/2.webp?v=2171af18b1",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "3 min",
   "time_html": "<span>3 min</span>",
   "title": "Slice the Spam",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-f=\"can|cans\" data-n=\"1\">1 can</span>",
     "name_html": "Spam (canned luncheon meat)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Beat the eggs with the sugar and salt.</li><li>Cook as one thin omelette in a lightly oiled small pan over medium-low heat, without browning; flip once.</li><li>Cut it into 8 pieces the size of a Spam slice (fold it to stack two layers if it's thin).</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium-low",
    "label_html": "<span>medium-low</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
