   },
   "n": 3,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~5 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~5 min</span>",
   "title": "Egg layer (optional)",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"3\" data-n=\"1\">3</span>",
     "name_html": "Eggs"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Sugar"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "a pinch",
     "name_html": "Salt"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat the oil in a large frying pan over <b>medium-high</b> heat.</li><li>Lay the slices in one layer and sear 3–5 minutes in all, flipping halfway, until caramelised and golden-brown on both sides.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium-high",
    "label_html": "<span>medium-high</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-4",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Sear the Spam",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Sear in one layer, 3–5 minutes in all, flipping halfway.",
      "src": "illustrations/spam-musubi/4-how1.webp?v=99f0c27e5b"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/spam-musubi/4.webp?v=9d67b3d5b4",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 4,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "3–5 min",
   "time_html": "<span>3–5 min</span>",
   "title": "Sear the Spam",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Neutral oil"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour the sauce over the Spam and cook 1–2 minutes, flipping once, until it bubbles down to a thick, shiny glaze that coats the slices.</li><li>Take them out straight away onto a plate, with a little of the glaze — left in the hot pan, the sugar burns.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium-high",
    "label_html": "<span>medium-high</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-5",
   "images": {
