   "part_id": null,
   "time": "1–2 min",
   "time_html": "<span>1–2 min</span>",
   "title": "Glaze",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lay a strip of nori <b>shiny side down</b> on the board and set the mold across its middle.</li><li>Wet the rice paddle and fill the mold evenly with warm rice, about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 cm</span> (¾ in) deep — roughly ⅛ of the rice.</li><li><b>No mold:</b> line the clean can with plastic wrap, pack the rice in the bottom, press it flat, lift it out by the wrap and unwrap it onto the nori.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-6",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Rice into the mold",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Nori strip shiny side down, mold across its middle, warm rice in about 2 cm deep.",
