    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"4\">4 tbsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Furikake"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Fold one end of the nori strip up over the Spam, then the other, snug, like a belt round the middle.</li><li>Dab a little water on the overlap to seal it and set it seam side down.</li><li>Repeat for all 8. Eat warm or at room temperature; cut in half with a wet knife if you like.</li></ul>",
